        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Teams: St. Louis Rams\n- People: Jeff Fisher, Sam Bradford\n- Organizations: National Football League, Minnesota Vikings\n- Places: St. Louis\n- Roles: head coach, starting quarterback\n- Seasons: 2012 St. Louis Rams season\n\nFacts:\n- The 2012 St. Louis Rams season was the St. Louis Rams' 75th season in the National Football League and their 18th overall season in St. Louis.\n- The 2012 season was the St. Louis Rams' first under new head coach Jeff Fisher.\n- Sam Bradford was born on November 8, 1987.\n- Sam Bradford is an American football quarterback.\n- During the 2012 St. Louis Rams season, Sam Bradford was in his second and final full season as the Rams' starting quarterback.\n- Two torn ACLs sidelined Sam Bradford for much of the next season and the entire 2014 season.\n- Sam Bradford played for the Minnesota Vikings of the National Football League.",
